Digital "Donor Passport" & QR Code Verification
Solve the problem of "fake" records or identity verification.

The Tech: QR Code generation and PDF kit.

The Feature: Every donor gets a unique QR code. When they arrive at the hospital, the hospital scans the code to:

Instantly verify their blood group.

Automatically update their "Last Donated" date in your database.

Issue a digital "Certificate of Appreciation" (PDF).

Why it gets you hired: It demonstrates an understanding of end-to-end user workflows and security/verification.






